  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for expat",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for expat fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-77214: out-of-bounds read due to insufficient checks in `XML_ParseBuffer()` (bsc#1284334).\n- CVE-2026-93990: fails to validate low surrogates following high surrogates in UTF-16 input (bsc#1282347).\n- CVE-2026-102633: denial of service via integer overflow in expat_realloc (bsc#1283493).\n\nChanges for expat:\n\nUpdate to 2.8.5 (jsc#PED-16154):\n\n * Bug fixes:\n * Fix an OOM-related memory leak on a failed overflow check\n * Fix memory alignment for architectures with 128bit pointers\n * Mark XML_SetHashSalt deprecated\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
